s/4ec43659-c218-45a4-ace6-7506cc74e908.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2023","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/ba4379c3-efc5-4b6b-8c8b-c79aab986926.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2022","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/517041/73406517041.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2021","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/517041/68972517041.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2020","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/517041/65254517041.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/517041/5170410319.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/517041/5170410318.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/517041/5170410317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/517041/5170410316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/517041/5170410315.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/517041/5170410314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/517041/5170410313.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://archives.nseindia.com/annual_reports/AR_539_ADORWELD_2012_2013_16072013134530.zip","source":"the data provider"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Ador Welding reported strong Q1 FY27 financial performance with revenue growing 23% year-on-year to Rs. 309 crore, reflecting healthy order inflows and continued momentum from FY26. Management highlighted that operating margins are expected to remain stable, supported by an improving product mix, cost discipline, and higher capacity utilization. The ongoing Rs. 80 crore modernization and expansion capex program is being funded through internal cash generation without additional leverage.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"Operating margins are expected to remain at similar levels.","quote":"Operating margins are expected to remain at similar levels, supported by an improving product mix, cost discipline, and higher capacity utilization.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=e8503d92-2e8f-4912-afeb-c7873b39baed.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Rising labour costs increase demand for productivity and efficiency, making automation a strategic priority.","quote":"Automation remains a strategic priority as rising labour costs increase demand for productivity and efficiency.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=e8503d92-2e8f-4912-afeb-c7873b39baed.pdf"},{"claim":"Management noted that order book, inquiry base, and approvals indicate that exports should do well and better for the markets they operate in.","quote":"So far this year, what we have seen is the order book, inquiry base, and approvals where we are set up, exports should do better -- should do well, should do better for the markets we operate in.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a2247604-95cb-42ea-8a00-5290f24ff647.pdf"},{"claim":"Management observed that demand is all right and not bad, despite customers being a bit cautious due to inflationary impacts.","quote":"Demand is all right, it is not bad. Given all the macroeconomic circumstances, in fact, I would imagine it could have been worse, it is not.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a2247604-95cb-42ea-8a00-5290f24ff647.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that shipbuilding, structural, automotive, thermal, and oil and gas are seeing green shoots and activity.","quote":"So I think in terms of industry, first, I think there are a few industries that -- I mean, you guys will know better than me -- but we are seeing green shoots obviously, shipbuilding, a little bit on some structural, wind, like I said, even though it is not a big thing for us at the moment but we are seeing a lot of activity there to get us approved and stuff like that. Automotive is picking up, doing all right on that front.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a2247604-95cb-42ea-8a00-5290f24ff647.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"Management stated that capital expenditure for the coming year is generally in the region of approximately INR30 crores to INR35 crores.","quote":"Our capex is generally in the region of approximately INR30 crores-INR35 crores for the coming year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a2247604-95cb-42ea-8a00-5290f24ff647.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that maintenance capex is in the region of INR10 crores to INR12 crores.","quote":"Yes, so we have generally a maintenance capex and it will come anywhere in the region of INR10 crores-INR12 crores type scenario.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a2247604-95cb-42ea-8a00-5290f24ff647.pdf"},{"claim":"Management expects total capex of INR30 crores to INR35 crores, potentially stretching to INR40 crores over the next two years each year.","quote":"So we expect INR30 crores- INR35 crores, even it could stretch it out to INR40 maybe at the most over the next two years, each year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a2247604-95cb-42ea-8a00-5290f24ff647.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Management reported gross margin at approximately 36% and PBT at approximately INR39 crores for Quarter 4.","quote":"Gross margin was approximately 36% and the PBT was at approximately INR39 crores.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a2247604-95cb-42ea-8a00-5290f24ff647.pdf"},{"claim":"Management reported standalone gross margins at 38% (up about 250 bps) and EBITDA margin at 12% for the year.","quote":"For the year standalone, revenue is up about 2%, gross margins at 38%, up about 250 bps. The EBITDA margin at 12%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a2247604-95cb-42ea-8a00-5290f24ff647.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated there is room left to improve EBITDA margins by another 100 to 200 basis points going forward over coming periods.","quote":"And there is still a little bit of room left. So I think on a similar trajectory, you can see that happen, for another 100, 200 basis points going forward over the coming periods.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a2247604-95cb-42ea-8a00-5290f24ff647.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"Management stated that some equipment lines currently operate at 90% to 95% capacity.","quote":"There are some lines that currently operate at 90%-95% for which we need to undertake capex, some new technologies we need to invest for as well, but yes, pretty much along that.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a2247604-95cb-42ea-8a00-5290f24ff647.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Management stated that an income tax appeal was filed last week regarding an income tax demand.","quote":"So income tax matter, we have filed our appeal last week only and we don't see any merit, means that the department will succeed in that.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a2247604-95cb-42ea-8a00-5290f24ff647.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"Management stated that EBITDA margin improvements will be seen over the next few quarters.","quote":"But surely over the next few quarters, you will see EBITDA margin improvements happening.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a2247604-95cb-42ea-8a00-5290f24ff647.pdf","timeframe":"next few quarters"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_ppt","concall_transcript"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":14,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":9,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}